cff_seed.vsdx is a file written by Microsoft Visio. It is the blank
cross-functional flowchart that Visio creates from its own template, and it
carries Visio's stock shapes (Process, Decision, Start/End, Dynamic connector,
Swimlane). cursus uses it as the starting point for every file it writes, so
the output holds what Visio itself writes rather than a guess at it.

This copy comes from the vsdxkit project
(https://github.com/firmfooting/vsdxkit, tests/fixtures/com_reference/
s05_swimlanes_cfflow.vsdx), BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2020 Dave Howard,
Copyright (c) 2026 Firm Footing. The stock shapes inside it are Microsoft's.

